<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-11-24T14:02:19.642Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:02:19 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Chinese Maritime Militia vessels carried out dangerous maneuvers against the Philippine patrol boat BRP Cabra and its RHIB, and two CMMVs were repelled after anchoring illegally, while the number of Chinese vessels monitored in the West Philippine Sea rose to 48 following the ASEAN Summit 2026. The Philippines and France conducted joint naval exercises that tested operational capabilities, and the Philippines and Japan added five new Coast Guard vessels to their maritime security cooperation, while Finland signed a maritime security pact that includes Australian assistance for drones and cybersecurity. A 28‑year-old man was killed by his younger brother in a stabbing in Ozamiz City. 176 battle-related deaths were reported in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/china-asean-countries-struggle-over-south-china-sea-code-of-conduct/a-80009799?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxPdG9xRGlUcXpHUElDbHNsUngxcVRLbHFlSEVJb2xrbTJJODhlRUN0aU85UFVPMGsxS1A2S0kyemlmRExfYUN6Z1JvUGpXSFVzbXRKRTdzUnUtR01MWDAyRzhCMHd1OHdGZ2RpTlp1VHp1SV9CamhDMkE5SmZLWVJUNm5mOU1vNFpnMTFkVGJOVHJXSVdrb0pZ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Philippine News Agency&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxObnR3cUFncjZtN1hTNktvb1g2UktPWnRFbWVWalJWeGZ4TTFhUlgybWhzZjdDeXhZV1NhZUJTYTJjaUNVZlBfLS1ORnJ0UkN0Z3E4ZlNZemFfUGs5R2UyeEpoNV9lTEZkbWlyODNMMi02TENERzBDdEhXR1ZfSklkOWJod1FJNVlBcDRsVWVQUjJuT3FiYzE4?oc=5&quot;&gt;thephilbiznews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxPWjlVMmVOVEVWaFpOd3VOT3Bxcmc3dTRzeHJMUXJiMHdSa2N4QmxHSXV4dTR6eXlKRT